    inven
    inventory
  phrase carried-me when the player holds the something valuable
  phrase carried-wire when the player holds the platinum wire
  phrase carried-uranium when the player holds the uranium
  phrase carried-statue when the player holds the ancient statue
  phrase carried-nuggets when the player holds the gold nuggets
