## LIGHT and ON, EXTIN and OFF, lines 2760 to 2810. The noun is never read:
## LIGHT ROCK lights the lamp.

define action lighting
  grammar
    light
    light the thing
    on
    on the thing
  the player must hold the electric lamp: no-lamp
  refuse when the player's lamp-life > 300: lamp-no-power
  refuse when the electric lamp is shining: already-on
  change the electric lamp to shining
  phrase lamp-is-lit

  phrases en-US
    no-lamp:
      You don't have a lamp.
    lamp-no-power:
      The lamp has no more power.
    already-on:
      It's already on.
    lamp-is-lit:
      The lamp is lit.

define action extinguishing
  grammar
    extinguish
    extinguish the thing
    extin
    extin the thing
    off
    off the thing
  the player must hold the electric lamp: no-lamp
  the electric lamp must be shining: lamp-not-on
  change the electric lamp to dormant
  phrase lamp-is-out

  phrases en-US
    lamp-not-on:
      It isn't on.
    lamp-is-out:
      The lamp is extinguished.

## A flag the long handlers use to remember that they have already spoken,
## because a Chord body has no "else": each line carries its own condition.

create the narrator
  a thing
  states, reversible: quiet, speaking, spoken

## A second flag, for THROW: whether the throw is still an ordinary drop.

create the umpire
  a thing
  states, reversible: watching, satisfied

## An action's `must` and `refuse` lines are all tried before its body runs,
## whatever order they are written in. So a handler that changes something
## and then answers is written entirely as body lines, with the narrator
## marking which answer has been given.

## DROP, lines 2180 to 2250. The special cases come in the original's order.
## A thing dropped is a thing dropped: every case but room 85's still lands
## the thing here before it is eaten, taken or thrown down a well.

define action dropping-it
  grammar
    drop the item
  refuse without item: what
  the player must hold the item: not-carrying
  refuse when the item is the large emerald: emerald-stuck
  refuse when the item is the radiation-proof container and the player holds the minuature sun: drop-contents-first
  refuse when the item is the radiation-proof container and the player holds the uranium: drop-contents-first
  change the narrator to quiet
  phrase woman-picks-up-laser when the item is the laser pistol and the woman is here
  raise the player's score by 100 when the item is the laser pistol and the woman is here and the player is in the Room 87
  win game-is-yours when the item is the laser pistol and the woman is here and the player is in the Room 87
  phrase wall-materializes when the item is the laser pistol and the player is in the Room 86
  change the wall to solid when the item is the laser pistol and the player is in the Room 86 and the wall is breached
  phrase sun-melts-ice when the item is the minuature sun and the ice is here
  move the large diamonds here when the item is the minuature sun and the ice is here
  remove the ice when the item is the minuature sun and the ice is here
  lower the player's burden by 1
  lower the player's burden by 1 when the item is the glass bottle and the player holds the water
  lower the player's burden by 1 when the item is the water and the player holds the glass bottle
  move the water here when the item is the glass bottle and the player holds the water
  move the glass bottle here when the item is the water and the player holds the glass bottle
  raise the player's score by 25 when (the item is the something valuable or the item is the platinum wire or the item is the uranium or the item is the ancient statue or the item is the gold nuggets or the item is the gold record or the item is the gold garbage or the item is the gold pet's dish or the item is the silver or the item is the large diamonds or the item is the gold telescope or the item is the large emerald or the item is the rare coins or the item is the rare stamps or the item is the black pearl or the item is the golden key) and the player is in the Building
  move the item here
  change the narrator to spoken when the player is in the Nameless Room
  move the item to the City when the player is in the Nameless Room
  move the player to the City when the player is in the Nameless Room
  phrase cat-eats-rat when the item is the rat and the cat is here
  change the cat to fed when the item is the rat and the cat is here
  change the narrator to spoken when the item is the rat and the cat is here
  remove the rat when the item is the rat and the cat is here
  phrase dog-takes-bone when the item is the bone and the dog is here
  change the narrator to spoken when the item is the bone and the dog is here
  remove the dog when the item is the bone and the dog is here
  remove the bone when the item is the bone and the narrator is spoken
  phrase dwarf-eats-coal when the item is the lump of coal and the player is in the Dwarf City
  change the narrator to spoken when the item is the lump of coal and the player is in the Dwarf City
  remove the dwarf when the item is the lump of coal and the player is in the Dwarf City
  remove the lump of coal when the item is the lump of coal and the player is in the Dwarf City
  phrase cat-opens-vault when the item is the cat and the player is in the Vault of City
  change the narrator to spoken when the item is the cat and the player is in the Vault of City
  change the vault to forced when the item is the cat and the player is in the Vault of City and the vault is sealed
  move the golden key to the Vault of City when the item is the cat and the player is in the Vault of City
  remove the cat when the item is the cat and the player is in the Vault of City
  change the narrator to spoken when the item is the penny and the player is in the Well
  move the rare coins to the Well when the item is the penny and the player is in the Well
  remove the penny when the item is the penny and the player is in the Well
  phrase rat-eats-cheese when the item is the piece of cheese and the rat is here and the rat is hungry
  phrase animal-sniffs when the item is the piece of cheese and the rat is here and the rat is dead
  phrase animal-sniffs when the item is the piece of cheese and the cat is here and not the rat is here
  change the narrator to spoken when the item is the piece of cheese and the rat is here
  change the narrator to spoken when the item is the piece of cheese and the cat is here
  change the cat to hungry when the item is the piece of cheese and the rat is here and the rat is hungry
  remove the piece of cheese when the item is the piece of cheese and the rat is here and the rat is hungry
  change the rat to dead when the item is the rat and the rat is here and the rat is hungry and the cat is hungry
  change the rat to dead when the cat is hungry and the rat is hungry
  phrase done when the narrator is quiet

## THROW, TOSS and GIVE, lines 2260 to 2270. A rock thrown at something
## living has its own outcomes; anything else thrown is dropped, by the same
## lines as DROP (the original jumps to 2210).

define action throwing-it
  grammar
    throw the item
    toss the item
    give the item
  refuse without item: what
  the player must hold the item: not-carrying
  refuse when the item is the rock and the robot is here and not the Gnome is here and not the woman is here and not the dwarf is here: rock-bounces
  refuse when the item is the rock and the dog is here and not the Gnome is here and not the woman is here and not the dwarf is here: spca
  refuse when the item is the rock and the cat is here and not the Gnome is here and not the woman is here and not the dwarf is here: spca
  refuse when the item is the large emerald: emerald-stuck
  refuse when the item is the radiation-proof container and the player holds the minuature sun: drop-contents-first
  refuse when the item is the radiation-proof container and the player holds the uranium: drop-contents-first
  change the narrator to quiet
  change the umpire to watching when the umpire is satisfied
  phrase woman-catches-laser when the item is the laser pistol and the woman is here
  raise the player's score by 100 when the item is the laser pistol and the woman is here and the player is in the Room 87
  win game-is-yours when the item is the laser pistol and the woman is here and the player is in the Room 87
  change the narrator to speaking when the item is the rock and the Gnome is here and the narrator is quiet
  phrase rock-hits-gnome when the narrator is speaking
  remove the Gnome when the narrator is speaking
  change the umpire to satisfied when the narrator is speaking
  change the narrator to spoken when the narrator is speaking
  lose woman-stunned when the item is the rock and the woman is here and the narrator is quiet
  change the narrator to speaking when the item is the rock and the dwarf is here and the narrator is quiet
  phrase dwarf-dodges when the narrator is speaking
  change the story to dying when the narrator is speaking
  change the umpire to satisfied when the narrator is speaking
  change the narrator to spoken when the narrator is speaking
  change the narrator to quiet when the umpire is watching and the narrator is spoken
  phrase woman-picks-up-laser when the item is the laser pistol and the woman is here and the umpire is watching
  raise the player's score by 100 when the item is the laser pistol and the woman is here and the player is in the Room 87 and the umpire is watching
  win game-is-yours when the item is the laser pistol and the woman is here and the player is in the Room 87 and the umpire is watching
  phrase wall-materializes when the item is the laser pistol and the player is in the Room 86 and the umpire is watching
  change the wall to solid when the item is the laser pistol and the player is in the Room 86 and the wall is breached and the umpire is watching
  phrase sun-melts-ice when the item is the minuature sun and the ice is here and the umpire is watching
  move the large diamonds here when the item is the minuature sun and the ice is here and the umpire is watching
  remove the ice when the item is the minuature sun and the ice is here and the umpire is watching
  lower the player's burden by 1 when the umpire is watching
  lower the player's burden by 1 when the item is the glass bottle and the player holds the water and the umpire is watching
  lower the player's burden by 1 when the item is the water and the player holds the glass bottle and the umpire is watching
  move the water here when the item is the glass bottle and the player holds the water and the umpire is watching
  move the glass bottle here when the item is the water and the player holds the glass bottle and the umpire is watching
  raise the player's score by 25 when (the item is the something valuable or the item is the platinum wire or the item is the uranium or the item is the ancient statue or the item is the gold nuggets or the item is the gold record or the item is the gold garbage or the item is the gold pet's dish or the item is the silver or the item is the large diamonds or the item is the gold telescope or the item is the large emerald or the item is the rare coins or the item is the rare stamps or the item is the black pearl or the item is the golden key) and the player is in the Building and the umpire is watching
  move the item here when the umpire is watching
  change the narrator to spoken when the player is in the Nameless Room and the umpire is watching
  move the item to the City when the player is in the Nameless Room and the umpire is watching
  move the player to the City when the player is in the Nameless Room and the umpire is watching
  phrase cat-eats-rat when the item is the rat and the cat is here and the umpire is watching
  change the cat to fed when the item is the rat and the cat is here and the umpire is watching
  change the narrator to spoken when the item is the rat and the cat is here and the umpire is watching
  remove the rat when the item is the rat and the cat is here and the umpire is watching
  phrase dog-takes-bone when the item is the bone and the dog is here and the umpire is watching
  change the narrator to spoken when the item is the bone and the dog is here and the umpire is watching
  remove the dog when the item is the bone and the dog is here and the umpire is watching
  remove the bone when the item is the bone and the narrator is spoken and the umpire is watching
  phrase dwarf-eats-coal when the item is the lump of coal and the player is in the Dwarf City and the umpire is watching
  change the narrator to spoken when the item is the lump of coal and the player is in the Dwarf City and the umpire is watching
  remove the dwarf when the item is the lump of coal and the player is in the Dwarf City and the umpire is watching
