  lower the player's burden by 1 when the narrator is quiet and the player holds the target
  remove the target when the narrator is quiet

## SHOOT with no target takes the highest-numbered of objects 31 to 45 that
## is in the room (line 2425). The ones that answer back are written out.

define action shooting-blind
  grammar
    shoot
    fire
  the player must hold the laser pistol: no-gun
  refuse when the player's shots > 5: laser-empty
  change the narrator to quiet
  change the narrator to speaking when the wall is here and the narrator is quiet
  raise the player's shots by 1 when the narrator is speaking
  phrase hole-blasted when the narrator is speaking
  change the wall to breached when the wall is solid and the narrator is speaking
  change the narrator to spoken when the narrator is speaking
  change the narrator to speaking when the computer is here and the narrator is quiet
  raise the player's shots by 1 when the narrator is speaking
  phrase computer-destroyed when the narrator is speaking
  change the computer to wrecked when the computer is humming and the narrator is speaking
  change the narrator to spoken when the narrator is speaking
  change the narrator to speaking when the lever is here and the narrator is quiet
  raise the player's shots by 1 when the narrator is speaking
  phrase disintegrates when the narrator is speaking
  remove the lever when the narrator is speaking
  change the narrator to spoken when the narrator is speaking
  change the narrator to speaking when the cart is here and the narrator is quiet
