## RUB, lines 2500 to 2510. Rubbing is the only way to pick the emerald up.

define action rubbing
  grammar
    rub the item
  refuse without item: what
  refuse when the item is not the large emerald: nothing-happens
  change the narrator to quiet
  change the narrator to spoken when the player holds the large emerald
  phrase emerald-sticks when the narrator is quiet
  raise the player's burden by 1 when the narrator is quiet
  lower the player's score by 25 when the narrator is quiet and the player is in the Building
  move the large emerald to the Adventurer when the narrator is quiet
  phrase emerald-falls when the narrator is spoken
  lower the player's burden by 1 when the narrator is spoken
  raise the player's score by 25 when the narrator is spoken and the player is in the Building
  move the large emerald here when the narrator is spoken
  phrase done

